      "description": "UNC Charlotte Applicant Site | Search Jobs Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Job Alerts Log In /Create Account Help Frequently Asked Questions Application Process State of NC Salary Chart Campus Security Report Student Employment Search  Postings (91) Hide Search Options View all open Postings below, or enter search criteria to narrow your search. Keywords Posted Within Any time period Last Day Last Week Last Month Department No Selection Academic Affairs (Adm) Academic Services (Adm) Advancing Fac Success (Adm) Alumni Engagement (Adm) Assessment and Accreditation (Adm) Athletics (Adm) Athletics Venues (Adm) Budget (Adm) Business Affairs (Adm) Business Services (Adm) Chancellor (Adm) Charlotte Global (Adm) Classroom Support Services (Adm) Col of Arts & Architecture (Col) Col of Hum & Erth and Soc Sci (Col) Col of Science (Col) Coll of Computing&Informatics (Col) College of Business (Col) College of Education (Col) College of Engineering (Col) College of Health & Human Svc (Col) Community Relations (Adm) Data Science Initiative (Adm) Dean of Students (Adm) Digital & Professional Learn (Adm) Div of Research (Adm) Enrollment Management (Adm) Extnal Relation&Partnerships (Adm) Facilities Management (Adm) Financial Services (Adm) Graduate School (Adm) Health & Wellbeing (Adm) Honors College (Adm) Housing and Residence Life (Adm) Human Resources (Adm) Institutional Integrity (Adm) Internal Audit (Adm) Levine Scholars Program (Adm) Library (Adm) Office of Inst Effect & Analyt (Adm) Office of OneIT (Adm) Public Info & Events (Adm) Reorganizations Safety & Security (Adm) Strategic&Success Initiatives (Adm) Student Affairs (Adm) Student Engagement (Adm) University Advance Operations (Adm) University Advancement VC (Adm) University College (Adm) University Comm & Marketing (Adm) University Development (Adm) University Events University Ombuds (Adm) Urban Institute (Adm) Employment Type No Selection Permanent - Full-time Permanent - Part-time Temporary - Full-time Temporary - Part-time Time Limited - Full-time Time Limited - Part-time Position Number Position Designation No Selection Adjunct / Part-Time Faculty EHRA Non-Faculty Faculty Non-Student Temporary Post Doc Senior Academic & Administrative Officer (SAAO) SHRA Staff Previous 1 2 3 4 Next View Results (91\n    ) Position Number Department Postion Type Job Close Date Benefits Consultant 000517 Benefits EHRA Non-Faculty The Benefits Consultant Generalist provides adaptable, cross‑functional support across core benefits functions. This role delivers consultations and case management for leaves of absence, retirement processing, onboarding and offboarding activities, and related benefits administration. The consultant manages high‑volume inquiries, time‑sensitive casework, and ensures accurate application of fed... View Details Bookmark Library Communications Specialist 009105 Library SHRA 09/15/2026 The Library Communications Specialist will be responsible for a variety of tasks that contribute to engagement, effective communications, marketing, and outreach activities for the library. The position will work with the director to create, maintain, and analyze content for the library’s digital media, website, and printed materials. The position will support and, in some cases, lead the execu... View Details Bookmark Award Management Specialist 003958 Off Sponsored Research Admin (SRA) EHRA Non-Faculty Professional Knowledge, Investigator Support & Financial AnalysisProvide comprehensive sponsored project oversight and serve as the primary point of contact for PIs seeking support for post-award management activities.Perform financial analysis of award spending, calculate burn rates, and provide highly accurate spending projections to guide research planning.Collect and analyze financial d... View Details Bookmark Academic Advisor I 003539 College of Computing & Informatics EHRA Non-Faculty 09/20/2026 The Academic Advisor in the College of Computing and Informatics (CCI) will assume advising responsibilities for any University students declaring or expressing an interest in College of Computing and Informatics majors. The advisor must be able to work autonomously in a complex, team-oriented academic office with a significant advising caseload. The advisor must be committed to student success... View Details Bookmark Sports Performance Coach for Baseball and Softball 001248 Athletics Admin/Support EHRA Non-Faculty Provide an environment where student athletes can succeed both academically and athletically in softball and baseball. Coach student-athletes in strength and conditioning for softball and baseball. Assist with game-day duties, camps, and recruiting for both sports. View Details Bookmark Chief Executive Officer - Grid Modernization Engine in the Carolinas 001531 Div of Research VC Office EHRA Non-Faculty Strategic Leadership & Organizational GrowthDrive the overall vision, strategy, and execution to build and scale a high-impact grid modernization and energy transition initiative.Establish management operating structures and internal processes to support rapid organizational scaling and long-term sustainability.Recruit, retain, and mentor a high-performing leadership team within a technical... View Details Bookmark Assistant Director for Education Abroad 007813 Charlotte Global EHRA Non-Faculty 09/23/2026 The Assistant Director for Education Abroad assists the Director and Associate Director in the oversight of daily operations in the Office of Education Abroad, exchange and affiliate program student advising, new exchange, affiliate, and hybrid program development and implementation, updating and implementing pre-departure and re-entry orientations for students, contributing to the unit’s risk ... View Details Bookmark Alumni Communications Specialist 000032 University Advancement VC EHRA Non-Faculty 09/16/2026 Collaborate with Program Managers to develop tailored email marketing strategies for alumni events, defining audience targets, messaging angles, and send schedules.Write, design, and proofread engaging, brand-aligned email communications to promote alumni events, programs, and department initiatives. Design custom graphics as needed and select high-quality visual assets to elevate email aesthet... View Details Bookmark Assistant Athletic Director of Compliance 000100 Compliance EHRA Non-Faculty This position is responsible for interpreting NCAA rules and regulations and ensuring that UNC Charlotte remains in compliance with those rules.Serve as the primary Athletics Compliance liaison to the institutional Scholarship/Financial Aid Office and athletics CFO.Oversee administration, monitoring, and reconciliation of student-athlete financial aid, including awards, adjustments, scholarship... View Details Bookmark Administrative Support Specialist 000284 Controller SHRA 09/08/2026 This position audits/processes purchase order invoices from all University funding sources (State Appropriation, Federal Grants, Special Instructional and Auxiliary) using Banner, 49er Mart, and an imaging system.Issues payments to vendors and reimbursements for expenses incurred by employees, non-employees, and students in compliance with Federal, State, and University policies, guidelines, an... View Details Bookmark Transportation Services Supervisor 010228 Parking SHRA 09/22/2026 Supervise and lead staff on your shift to help ensure University and departmental standards and expectations are metManage employees’ work time and time off requests in time-keeping programs: KRONOS, Web Time Entry, and HumanityEnsure proper staff coverage is scheduled for regular work shifts, chartered and fixed-route services, special events, activities, and functionsSet a do-as-I-do by your ... View Details Bookmark Assistant Director of Business Services for HRL 010601 Housing and Residence Life EHRA Non-Faculty 09/22/2026 The Assistant Director of Business Services supports the Director of Business Services in administering the financial, personnel, and operational functions of Housing and Residence Life within a complex auxiliary environment. This position assists with managing a unified departmental budget exceeding $57 million and supports financial planning efforts associated with ongoing capital renovation ... View Details Bookmark Academic Advisor I 004699 College of Health & Human Svc EHRA Non-Faculty 09/07/2026 The position is responsible for providing accurate academic advising to individuals and groups of current and potential undergraduate students in the College. Advisors proactively communicate with students who have poor mid-term grade performance or who have other risk factors for retention and/or success. Advisors assist in the management and operation of the CHHS Advising Center as determined... View Details Bookmark Assistant Director for Fraternity and Sorority Life 012678 Office of Fraternity&Sorority Life EHRA Non-Faculty 09/07/2026 This position will oversee Well-being and Risk Management, with a large portion of this area being focused on overseeing the Standards Program, managing the collection, review, and reporting of annual assessments of chapter development, as well as working with chapters and councils to develop and maintain academic and education-focused success to increase the holistic student experience. The se... View Details Bookmark Assistant Director for Student Research Programs 003521 University College EHRA Non-Faculty 09/23/2026 The Assistant Director for the Office of Undergraduate Research (OUR) at UNC Charlotte supports efforts and programming aimed at supporting faculty, staff, and students’ participation in undergraduate research at UNC Charlotte. The Assistant Director will serve as the program manager for part of the university’s portfolio of undergraduate research programs, liaison for on-campus partners and ev... View Details Bookmark Senior Contract Officer 001327 Office of Research Services EHRA Non-Faculty Independently review and negotiate terms and conditions of complex award documents and contractual agreements with various sponsors to ensure compliance with policies, federal and state laws, and sponsor guidelines.Draft and negotiate agreements, including those for technical data and intellectual property rights, publication rights, payment terms, title to equipment, and travel regulations.Wri... View Details Bookmark Transfer Advisor 006766 Univ Transfer/Adult Stu Ctr EHRA Non-Faculty 09/18/2026 Provide academic advising to prospective and enrolled transfer and adult students through in-person and virtual appointments and other advising modalities.Maintain an assigned caseload of 49erNext students enrolled at North Carolina community colleges and provide proactive pre-transfer advising and follow-up.Assist students in understanding how prior credit may apply to degree requirements, inc... View Details Bookmark Assistant Director of Business Honors Program 001654 Undergraduate Programs EHRA Non-Faculty 09/13/2026 The Assistant Director of the Business Honors Program implements career and professional development programming and educational strategies to advance honors education in the Belk College of Business. The Business Honors Program is a special educational and professional development program supported by the Niblock Student Center in collaboration with the Director of the Business Honors Program,... View Details Bookmark Scholarship Administration Coordinator 001319 University Scholarship Office SHRA 10/05/2026 Serve as the primary contact for scholarship administrators and other departmental representatives seeking training, technical assistance, and resources that support scholarship administration.Understand and have the ability to clearly explain how scholarship donor agreements and funds are established, how to calculate scholarship fund balances, and what the functions are within the scholarship... View Details Bookmark Assistant Director of Transfer and Adult Student Advising 003478 Univ Transfer/Adult Stu Ctr EHRA Non-Faculty 09/18/2026 The Transfer and Adult Student Advisor supports prospective and enrolled students with prior college credit, including transfer and adult learners, by providing comprehensive academic advising and transition support. This position helps students understand how their credits apply, explore academic options, and identify coursework that supports a seamless transition into their intended major and... View Details Bookmark Clinical Professor & NC Economic Impact Center Director 004288 Economics Faculty The Department of Economics in the Belk College of Business at UNC Charlotte is seeking to fill a Clinical Professor position. The position involves both teaching and administrative responsibilities as Director of the newly established North Carolina Economic Impact Center. The candidate will be on a reduced teaching load of four sections during the academic year due to the Director duties. Spe... View Details Bookmark Police Officer PPS004 Police and Public Safety EHRA Non-Faculty 02/28/2027 This position performs law enforcement work at a University campus or other State facility. With full powers of arrest, positions enforce the laws of the State and the United States Government. Positions have law enforcement authority ranging from traffic control to criminal investigations within a limited geographic jurisdiction. Work involves patrolling an assigned area for response to compla... View Details Bookmark Building Operations Assistant STMP15 Library Temp Hire 09/11/2026 Assist with the library daily operations. Duties include, recycling, painting, changing lights, replacing ceiling tiles, mail room coverage, moving furniture, book donations pickups and deliveries on and off campus, cleaning furniture, repairing furniture, responding to emergency leaks, carpet spot cleaning and replacement, window cleaning, elevator track cleaning, office cleaning, special even... View Details Bookmark Building Operations Assistant STMP15 Library Temp Hire 09/11/2026 Assist with the library daily operations. Duties include, recycling, painting, changing lights, replacing ceiling tiles, mail room coverage, moving furniture, book donations pickups and deliveries on and off campus, cleaning furniture, repairing furniture, responding to emergency leaks, carpet spot cleaning and replacement, window cleaning, elevator track cleaning, office cleaning, special even... View Details Bookmark Temporary Financial Aid Assistant STMP15 Financial Aid Operations Temp Hire 09/13/2026 Manage daily, weekly, and monthly reports associated with the Office of Financial Aid involving but not limited to awarding, residency, unusual enrollment, student semester enrollment, Federal Pell Grants, Federal TEACH Grant, and Transient Study processing.Performs specialized duties to support Pell Grant and TEACH Grant programs.Provides accurate and timely information about financial aid pol... View Details Bookmark Business Services Coordinator 001484 College of Business SHRA 09/09/2026 The Business Services Coordinator is part of the Belk College of Business Finance & Personnel Team and provides direct support to the Assistant Director and Assistant Dean of Finance and Personnel. This position, along with 4 other team members reporting to the Assistant Dean, is responsible for processing all financial transactions and personnel actions originating in the Belk College of B... View Details Bookmark Temporary Research Support Pool-Hourly STMP15 All departments Temp Hire 09/30/2026 * Responsibilities may include: conducting experiments, collecting and summarizing data, and providing proper laboratory/study subject care.* Duties will vary by departmental needs. View Details Bookmark Temporary Research Support Pool-Salaried STMP18 All departments Temp Hire 09/30/2026 * Responsibilities may include: conducting experiments, collecting and summarizing data, and providing proper laboratory/study subject care.* Duties will vary by departmental needs. View Details Bookmark Inventory Control Specialist 007747 DPL-Learning Space Technology SHRA 09/20/2026 The Inventory Control Specialist provides inventory management for all items that are procured, installed, and supported by the AV Integration and Classroom Support Teams as part of Learning Space Technology, reporting to the Digital and Professional Learning Unit. This position requires previous experience maintaining inventories and ordering and supplying necessary project items while maintai... View Details Bookmark FMT Building Trades Technician 1 010591 FM General Trades Shop SHRA 09/07/2026 Duties include but are not limited to:Provide career tracks in trades such as caulking, coating, masonry, painting, plastering, and roofing, which encompass tasks ranging from routine and unskilled to highly skilled.Apply methods and general procedures of relevant trades and maintenance techniques, while developing proficiency in procedures, techniques, tools, materials, and equipment appropria... View Details Bookmark Previous 1 2 3 4 Next 9201 University City Blvd \r\nCharlotte, NC 28223 © 2026 The University of North Carolina at Charlotte. All rights reserved. To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
