iries, time‑sensitive casework, and ensures accurate application of fed... View Details Bookmark Assistant Director of Transfer and Adult Student Advising 003478 Univ Transfer/Adult Stu Ctr EHRA Non-Faculty 09/18/2026 The Transfer and Adult Student Advisor supports prospective and enrolled students with prior college credit, including transfer and adult learners, by providing comprehensive academic advising and transition support. This position helps students understand how their credits apply, explore academic options, and identify coursework that supports a seamless transition into their intended major and... View Details Bookmark Salesforce Senior Developer 008074 OneIT - Enterprise Applications EHRA Non-Faculty Salesforce Development & EngineeringDesigns, develops, tests, and deploys complex Salesforce solutions using Apex, Lightning Web Components (LWC), Aura, SOQL/SOSL, and other platform technologies.Builds scalable, reusable components and applies best practices for performance, security, and maintainability.Serves as a technical expert for Salesforce development, setting direction for complex... View Details Bookmark Transfer Advisor 006766 Univ Transfer/Adult Stu Ctr EHRA Non-Faculty 09/18/2026 Provide academic advising to prospective and enrolled transfer and adult students through in-person and virtual appointments and other advising modalities.Maintain an assigned caseload of 49erNext students enrolled at North Carolina community colleges and provide proactive pre-transfer advising and follow-up.Assist students in understanding how prior credit may apply to degree requirements, inc... View Details Bookmark Translation Program Director 001937 Res Trans & Indust Alliance (ORTIA) EHRA Non-Faculty Conducts proactive, campus-wide engagement with UNC Charlotte researchers — in research centers, institutes, and directly with individual researchers not affiliated with any center — to identify research with commercial translation potential at TRL 2–3, before it self-selects through formal disclosure or exits through publication unrealized.Facilitates structured problem-framing sessions betwee... View Details Bookmark Assistant Director for Student Research Programs 003521 University College EHRA Non-Faculty 09/23/2026 The Assistant Director for the Office of Undergraduate Research (OUR) at UNC Charlotte supports efforts and programming aimed at supporting faculty, staff, and students’ participation in undergraduate research at UNC Charlotte. The Assistant Director will serve as the program manager for part of the university’s portfolio of undergraduate research programs, liaison for on-campus partners and ev... View Details Bookmark Senior Classification/Compensation Consultant 000511 Compensation and Position Management EHRA Non-Faculty UNC Charlotte is seeking a highly skilled, independent, and strategic Senior Classification and Compensation Consultant to drive excellence across the university’s workforce infrastructure. In this pivotal role, the Senior Classification and Compensation Consultant balances deep regulatory expertise with proactive campus partnership, focusing heavily on sophisticated compensation and job analys... View Details Bookmark Academic Advisor I 004699 College of Health & Human Svc EHRA Non-Faculty 09/07/2026 The position is responsible for providing accurate academic advising to individuals and groups of current and potential undergraduate students in the College. Advisors proactively communicate with students who have poor mid-term grade performance or who have other risk factors for retention and/or success. Advisors assist in the management and operation of the CHHS Advising Center as determined... View Details Bookmark Executive Director of Budget and Personnel 001936 Div of Research VC Office EHRA Non-Faculty The Executive Director of Budget and Personnel works closely with the Vice Chancellor and Associate Vice Chancellor to develop the Division or Research’s annual operating budget; leads the division annual budget call process; reviews and advises senior leadership on budget requests and presents to the Vice Chancellor and Associate Vice Chancellor; works with senior leadership within decentraliz... View Details Bookmark Assistant Athletic Director of Compliance 000100 Compliance EHRA Non-Faculty This position is responsible for interpreting NCAA rules and regulations and ensuring that UNC Charlotte remains in compliance with those rules.Serve as the primary Athletics Compliance liaison to the institutional Scholarship/Financial Aid Office and athletics CFO.Oversee administration, monitoring, and reconciliation of student-athlete financial aid, including awards, adjustments, scholarship... View Details Bookmark Associate Director of Affinity Engagement 000350 Alumni Engagement EHRA Non-Faculty Program ManagementThe Associate Director of Alumni Engagement is responsible for managing affinity-based alumni events and programs. Affinity-based events and programs are defined as events or programs organized by and for groups of alumni with a shared interest or experience. Events may be in person, on or off campus, as well as virtual. Affinity examples include, but are not limited to, geogr... View Details Bookmark Assistant Director for Education Abroad 007813 Charlotte Global EHRA Non-Faculty 09/23/2026 The Assistant Director for Education Abroad assists the Director and Associate Director in the oversight of daily operations in the Office of Education Abroad, exchange and affiliate program student advising, new exchange, affiliate, and hybrid program development and implementation, updating and implementing pre-departure and re-entry orientations for students, contributing to the unit’s risk ... View Details Bookmark Associate Director for HRL Content Operations 010620 Housing and Residence Life EHRA Non-Faculty 09/20/2026 Essential Job Duties:Lead and oversee the development and execution of Housing and Residence Life (HRL) content strategy aligned with departmental, divisional, and university prioritiesPlan, coordinate, and implement marketing campaigns across print, digital, web, social media, and video platformsServe as the primary lead for HRL communications, including crisis and emergency messagingDevelop, ... View Details Bookmark Sports Performance Coach for Baseball and Softball 001248 Athletics Admin/Support EHRA Non-Faculty Provide an environment where student athletes can succeed both academically and athletically in softball and baseball. Coach student-athletes in strength and conditioning for softball and baseball. Assist with game-day duties, camps, and recruiting for both sports. View Details Bookmark Library Business Officer 002170 Library EHRA Non-Faculty The Library Business Officer (LBO) plays a pivotal role in the financial, personnel, and operational leadership of the library. As a key member of the Dean’s leadership team, the Library Business Officer provides strategic oversight, guidance, communication, operational strategy, and decision-making in the areas of financial management and human resources. This position ensures that all busines... View Details Bookmark Award Management Specialist 003958 Off Sponsored Research Admin (SRA) EHRA Non-Faculty Professional Knowledge, Investigator Support & Financial AnalysisProvide comprehensive sponsored project oversight and serve as the primary point of contact for PIs seeking support for post-award management activities.Perform financial analysis of award spending, calculate burn rates, and provide highly accurate spending projections to guide research planning.Collect and analyze financial d... View Details Bookmark Previous 1 2 3 4 Next 9201 University City Blvd \r\nCharlotte, NC 28223 © 2026 The University of North Carolina at Charlotte. All rights reserved. To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
